---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout
    title="About | Project Cider"
    description="Learn about Project Cider, a student programming exchange built around peer learning, practical workshops, and sharing projects."
>
    <section class="content-panel" aria-labelledby="about-title">
        <p class="eyebrow">About the exchange</p>
        <h1 class="page-heading" id="about-title">Good ideas grow<br />when we share them.</h1>
        <p>
            Project Cider is a proposed student-led programming exchange.
            It brings students together to share practical skills, discuss
            their projects, and learn by building alongside one another.
        </p>
        <p class="intro-end">
            Whether you're writing your first programme or exploring a new tool,
            there's something to learn from another student's experience.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="activities" aria-labelledby="activities-title">
        <p class="eyebrow">What we're planning</p>
        <h2 id="activities-title">Learn from each other.</h2>
        <div class="activity-grid">
            <article>
                <h3>Practical workshops</h3>
                <p>Work through focused programming topics and try out useful tools with other students.</p>
            </article>
            <article>
                <h3>Student project sharing</h3>
                <p>Share something you've built, explain your decisions, and learn from constructive feedback.</p>
            </article>
            <article>
                <h3>Collaborative coding</h3>
                <p>Explore a small problem together, compare approaches, and practise working as a team.</p>
            </article>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="objectives" aria-labelledby="objectives-title">
        <h2 id="objectives-title">What we hope to build.</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>Confidence in applying programming knowledge to practical problems.</li>
            <li>A habit of sharing ideas, asking questions, and giving useful feedback.</li>
            <li>Connections between students with different interests and experience levels.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="programme-note">
            Coming soon. These activities describe the proposed direction;
            dates and programme details have not been confirmed.
        </p>
        <a class="text-link" href="/">Back to Project Cider <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
    .intro-end {
        margin-bottom: 0;
    }

    .activities,
    .objectives {
        margin-top: 3rem;
    }

    .activity-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: 2rem;
        margin-top: 1.75rem;
    }

    article {
        padding-top: 1.25rem;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    article h3 {
        color: var(--accent);
    }

    article p {
        margin-bottom: 0;
    }

    .objectives ul {
        padding-left: 1.25rem;
        color: var(--muted);
    }

    .objectives li + li {
        margin-top: 0.5rem;
    }

    .programme-note {
        margin-top: 1.75rem;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    @media (max-width: 50rem) {
        .activity-grid {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            gap: 1.5rem;
        }
    }
</style>